        "Melissa Daniels had this at Modern Retail yesterday, from Shoptalk.  Bob's Discount Furniture makes an original series called Til Decor Do Us Part, on its own channels, in which couples argue about how to furnish a room.  Season one, per the brand, did <mark>200 million views and generated 9 million dollars in sales.</mark>  Hold that number for a second, because the interesting part is season two.",
